    <panel_attributes>title=SD07 Start and submit a quiz attempt
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=QuizService~s
obj=QuizGrader~g
obj=QuizRepository~r
obj=ProgressTracker~t

u-&gt;f : startAttempt(courseId, quizId)
f-&gt;s : startAttempt(courseId, quizId)
s-&gt;r : saveAttempt(new attempt)
r.&gt;u : attempt ID
u-&gt;f : submitAttempt(courseId, attemptId, answers)
f-&gt;s : submitAttempt(courseId, attemptId, answers)
s:Check saved course and question IDs, preserve first submitted answers
s-&gt;g : grade(quiz, attempt)
g: ExactMatchGrading for objective answers
g: LLMRubricGrading for nonempty short answers
g.&gt;s : GRADED or PENDING results
s-&gt;r : saveAttempt(submitted attempt)
s-&gt;t : recordQuizAttempt(attempt)
t.&gt;u : score, pending state, progress and history
s:Repeated submission reuses saved answers and grades, pending answers do not enter accuracy</panel_attributes>
